[Unit]
Description=Arc'emX! factor mining, 12:00 UTC = 17:30 IST Mon-Fri (bumped from weekly Sat to daily 2026-09-06 - the buy-side signal drought (KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md section 26/26a: 0 "buy" ratings in 75 days) means this is now the more promising active search for a real signal; daily gives 7x more shots at clearing the deflated-Sharpe bar per unit time. Runs 30min after arcemx-daily-grader's 11:30 UTC slot so EOD data is settled and grader has long finished (now ~1-2min, was the multi-hour GH bottleneck - see section 40) - no longer 03:30 UTC piggybacking specialist_eval.yml's cadence, that was a GH Actions job on a different host anyway, and 03:30 UTC would now collide with arcemx-stock-analyst-dispatch.timer)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=Mon..Fri *-*-* 12:00:00
AccuracySec=1s
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
